# Repos a reviewer of THIS repo may search and cite, materialized under
# .siblings/<owner>/<repo>. One per line.
#
# plow owns the API this CLI calls and `cli/plow`, the other client for the
# same routes -- a reviewer that cannot see it cannot tell a new verb here
# from a second copy of one that already exists there.
#
# plow-hermes-agent is the base image this runs. Its boot contract decides
# what `compose.example.yml` and `mint` have to produce, so a review that
# cannot read it is guessing at the mount paths and the credential file.
#
# agent-mgr is the runner this one succeeds; it still owns container lifecycle
# and the fleet's Compose surface (agent-mgr#130), so the gate that routes
# those there has to be able to read it.
plow-pbc/plow
plow-pbc/plow-hermes-agent
plow-pbc/agent-mgr
